Subject: [PATCH 02/13] rust: expose fence and DRM lifecycle helpers for native
 GPU backends

Provide fence-signalling guards and bound-device event delivery for native
GPU backends. Reuse the existing sanitized arm64 feature API and DMA
mappings; no private architecture cache exports are needed.

